cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use mac4DSTEM in published work, please cite both this software and
  the py4DSTEM paper, which is the origin of the underlying methods and the
  reference implementation this port is validated against.
title: mac4DSTEM
abstract: >-
  A native macOS application for interactive four-dimensional scanning
  transmission electron microscopy (4D-STEM) analysis on Apple Silicon.
  Covers virtual imaging, calibration, Bragg disk detection, strain mapping,
  ACOM orientation mapping, and DPC/iDPC/parallax/ptychography phase
  reconstruction, with every result carrying its model, scale, units and
  validity through display, export and reopen. Algorithms are ported from
  py4DSTEM and validated against it on experimental data.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Lobpreis
    given-names: Paul
version: 2.5.0
date-released: "2026-09-04"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: https://github.com/mac4DSTEM/mac4DSTEM
url: https://mac4dstem.com
keywords:
  - 4D-STEM
  - scanning transmission electron microscopy
  - electron diffraction
  - strain mapping
  - orientation mapping
  - ptychography
  - macOS
  - Metal
references:
